[00:00.00] 作曲 : De Backer
[01:30.94]I'm living with your memory
[01:30.94]我与你回忆共存
[01:35.07]In the attic in my mind
[01:35.07]在脑海的阁楼深处
[01:39.66]And you've been getting by without me
[01:39.66]你已习惯没有我的日子
[01:42.84]But I've been spending all my time
[01:42.84]我却耗尽所有光阴
[01:48.77]With a girl that I remember
[01:48.77]与记忆中那个女孩
[01:53.07]Who'll never leave or need to grow
[01:53.07]她永不离去也无需成长
[01:57.31]Cuz when you left you left your memory
[01:57.31]因你离去时留下回忆
[02:00.81]Now it's the only thing I know
[02:00.81]如今这是我唯一所知
[02:24.30]When the past gives me no comfort
[02:24.30]当过往不再予我慰藉
[02:28.94]And though the future is the cost
[02:28.94]纵使未来需付出代价
[02:33.42]The way I'm choosing to remember
[02:33.42]我选择铭记的方式
[02:36.03]I'll forever be the man I never was
[02:36.03]将永远成为未竟之人
[02:41.48]And you, you fade
[02:41.48]而你 逐渐淡去
[02:49.93]But the memory remains the same
[02:49.93]但回忆始终如初
[02:59.39]And I, I can't change
[02:59.39]而我 无法改变
[03:07.83]And I think that living with your memory
[03:07.83]与你回忆共处的日子
[03:12.71]Is slowly driving me insane
[03:12.71]正逐渐使我陷入疯狂
[05:07.38]You are perfect but you're empty
[05:07.38]你完美却空洞
[05:11.55]And it gets so lonely in my mind
[05:11.55]我脑海中如此孤寂
[05:16.34]Cuz your image in my memory's
[05:16.34]因记忆中你的影像
[05:19.05]The only shred of you that's left behind
[05:19.05]是仅存的零星痕迹
[05:25.21]You were real but then you left me
[05:25.21]你曾真实却离我而去
[05:29.76]And that's the part I can't accept
[05:29.76]那是我无法接受的部分
[05:33.72]So I'll keep on living with your memory
[05:33.72]所以我将继续与回忆共存
[05:37.45]Because it's all that I've got left
[05:37.45]因这是我仅剩的所有
[05:41.30]It's all that I've got left
[05:41.30]这是我仅剩的所有
